  "plot_rules": "Four fixed figures: seven-epoch broad and core profiles in both frames with shared same-quantity y ranges; both native orders; both original full raw/excess panels. Every finite value is retained with 5% margin, missing/invalid/low-reference outcomes labelled. No alternate crop, contrast, mask, fit, background or subtraction.",
